{"id":2906001,"name":"MiniMax H3 All-In-One Uncensored Workflow (NSFW)","coverImageId":null,"sfwCoverImageId":null,"description":"<p>This is a MiniMax H3 workflow focusing on a few problems I've been trying to fix: the oily/plastic look from acceleration LoRAs, blurry distant faces, and quality loss in high-motion scenes. I also added a two-stage latent upscale workflow, so you can generate a quick low-res preview first, find a good seed, and then refine it to around 1080p. This saves quite a bit of time compared to doing the full-resolution generation every time. The workflow also uses a merged H3 model, so text-to-video, image-to-video, first/last frame, and multi-reference generation can all be handled in basically the same workflow.<br />For more details, please check the note within the workflow.</p><p>If you don't have the hardware to run this workflow locally, you could try this online (Free 48GB GPU）.</p><p>Links: <br />Dmad+SelfLift:<br /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2112077694410633218/?inviteCode=rh-v1546\">https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2112077694410633218</a><br />Cinematic Version:<br /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2101654857613963265/?inviteCode=rh-v1546\">https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2101654857613963265</a><br />V1:<br /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2094673232666742786/?inviteCode=rh-v1546\">https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2094673232666742786</a><br /><br /><span style=\"background-color:rgb(26, 27, 30);color:rgb(193, 194, 197);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Check the tutorial video for instructions before using this workflow:</span><br />Dmad+SelfLift Version:</p><div data-youtube-video><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"480\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" autoplay=\"false\" disablekbc